            "title": "Cimpress (CMPR) Reports Net Loss Of US$25 Million In Q4",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Cimpress (CMPR) experienced a notable price increase of 30% over the last quarter. This movement coincides with several corporate events, including an update on its buyback program, where the company repurchased nearly 479,000 shares for $21 million. Despite mixed earnings results\u2014with a reported net loss of $25 million in Q4, down from a net income the previous year\u2014Cimpress's consolidated overall sales climbed slightly. These company-specific events complemented the broader market trends,...",
